# Frontend

React 18 function components with **explicit props types**. Do not use `React.FC`. No `any`. Colocate a page with its `components/` folder and `*.scss`.

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| Pages / components | PascalCase | `ClubsPage.tsx` |
| Hooks | `use` + camelCase | `useFetch.ts` |
| API modules | camelCase `*Service` | `clubService.ts` |
| CSS | BEM-ish kebab | `.clubs-page__hero` |
| Types | PascalCase | `FloorballMatchDto` |

## Data and auth

- HTTP: `authFetch` from `src/frontend/src/api/utils/authFetch.ts` (JWT inject + single 401 refresh)
- Parse failures with `parseErrorResponse`
- Types live in `src/frontend/src/types/` or next to the service
- Public UI: floorball + football only. Hockey stays listed, not routed, unless asked

## i18n and routing

Finnish is default. Add keys to both `src/frontend/src/i18n/locales/fi/translation.json` and `en/translation.json`. Use `useTranslation()` — no user-facing English/Finnish literals in JSX.

Register screens in `src/frontend/src/router/routes.tsx` with `lazyWithRetry(() => import('...'))`. Wrap admin/club-admin routes in `ProtectedRoute`.

## UI

Reuse `PageTemplate`, `LoadingSpinner`, and existing admin tables/modals. Tailwind 4 (Vite plugin, no `tailwind.config.js`) plus SCSS. `pnpm` only (`pnpm lint`, `pnpm build`).
